# UI and theme

- Colors/type via `context.theme.appColors` and `context.theme.appTypography` (`util_extensions.dart`). Palette: `AppPalette` (primary `#E41E26`). Light theme only. Page transitions: `FadeUpwardsPageTransitionsBuilder` all platforms.
- Spacing: `allPadding*`, `hPadding*`, `vPadding*`, `hSpacer*`, radius constants — do not invent ad-hoc 24s when a constant exists. Screen inset is 24; pane gap 12. Checkout stacks below 900px width.
- AppBar: `centerTitle: false`, `toolbarHeight: 72`, `titleSpacing: 24`, logo `Image.asset(..., height: 32)` with keys `login-logo` / `catalog-logo` / `order-summary-logo`. Do not paint a white AppBar override.
- Catalog search is **60% of the AppBar title slot** (`constraints.maxWidth * 0.6`). Hint: `Search services`.
- Primary `FilledButton`: `minimumSize: const Size(230, 52)`, padding 32×16, `type.labelLarge`, `colors.primary` / `onPrimary`.
- Money: `formatRand` / `sellingPriceToCents` in `lib/presentation/shared/format_rand.dart`. Domain `sellingPrice` is a `double` (rands).
- Catalog grid uses `CatalogItemEntity` from the bloc. Tiles use `product_placeholder.png` on `colors.surface`.
- Keep widget `Key`s tests already use (`login-email`, `login-password`, `catalog-logo`, `cart-totals`, …).
